<h2 id='what-is-cloudways'>🌐 What Is Cloudways?</h2>

Cloudways is a managed cloud hosting platform that sits between you and raw cloud infrastructure providers — AWS, Google Cloud, DigitalOcean, Vultr, and Linode. Instead of spinning up and hardening your own VPS, you get a pre-configured, performance-optimized stack with one-click application deployments, built-in Cloudflare CDN integration, automated backups, and a unified control panel that doesn't require a sysadmin on retainer.

For luxury retail operators, the value proposition is specific: you get enterprise-grade infrastructure without an enterprise-grade IT department. A boutique with three locations and a flagship WooCommerce store doesn't have the headcount to manage server patches, PHP version upgrades, and Redis configuration. Cloudways handles all of that. You focus on the product and the customer experience.

The platform supports WordPress, WooCommerce, Magento, Laravel, and custom PHP applications out of the box. Luxury jewelry and watch brands almost universally land on WooCommerce or Magento — both are first-class citizens on Cloudways.

